%% Device transfer (layer 2): verified file bytes between the controller and one member.
%% Index and code mapping: docs/dev/arch-assets.md
sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Control source
  participant C as Controller Core
  participant P as Member peer listener
  participant R as Receiver temporary file
  S->>C: act device_transfer {from, to, expectedSha256?, overwrite?}
  C->>C: check online and reserve one receipt
  C->>P: admit through normal peer host authority
  C-->>S: pending receipt and read next action
  loop bounded LAN stream or tunnel range
    C->>P: upload or ranged download
    P->>R: write bytes and stream SHA-256
    R->>R: verify range, sync and checkpoint offset
    C->>C: checkpoint bytes, total, path and rate
  end
  R->>R: verify complete SHA-256, fsync and atomic publish
  C-->>S: completed receipt
  opt interrupted
    S->>C: same requestId reads receipt
    S->>C: explicit action resume
    C->>R: continue from verified receiver offset
  end
  opt cancel
    S->>C: action cancel
    C->>R: stop attempt and remove temporary file
  end
